Package: hmagmaR
Type: Package
Title: Incorporation of chromatin interaction and epigenetic profiles to predict risk genes
Version: 0.99.1
Authors@R: person("Aydan", "Asgarova", email = "aydan.asgarova00@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Combines chromatin interaction (e.g. PLAC-seq/Hi-C) data with regulatory
    region annotations (e.g. promoters, enhancers, H3K27ac) to link non-coding
    GWAS SNPs to their putative target genes, producing MAGMA-compatible gene
    annotation files for downstream gene-level association testing.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/aydanasg/hmagmaR
BugReports: https://github.com/aydanasg/hmagmaR/issues
